= Maintenance =

== Locking ==

To lock wiki add the following lines into LocalSettings.php:

<pre>
$wgReadOnly = 'This wiki is currently under maintenance.';
</pre>

To unlock wiki restore the original LocalSettings.php.

See also:
* [https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Manual:Lock_the_database Lock the database]
* [https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Manual:$wgReadOnly Manual:$wgReadOnly].
* [https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Manual:$wgReadOnlyFile Manual:$wgReadOnlyFile].

== Upgrading ==

To upgrade wiki:

<pre>
$ cd maintenance
$ php update.php
</pre>

See also [https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Manual:Update.php Update.php].

== Database Cleanup ==

To list users:

<pre>
mysql> select user_id, user_name, user_email from user order by user_name;
</pre>

To list user groups:

<pre>
mysql> select user_name, user_email, ug_group from user left join user_groups on user_id = ug_user order by user_name;
</pre>

